  {"op": "capture", "name": "pane_toasts_720", "desc": "1280x720, the GM's view after both events and before any undo, the drawer aside: the felled stand open on the board, and every event's toast with Undo ('The bridge fell for everyone at the table', 'The trees fell ...', 'The forest burned ...'), each in its event's own icon (bridge-broken, tree-falling, flame), stacked with their edges aligned"},
  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/events_pane.gd", "action": "player", "kinds": ["BRIDGE_COLLAPSE", "FOREST_FALL", "FIRE"], "phase": "look", "for": "pane_player_720"},
  {"op": "wait", "s": 1.0, "phase": "look", "for": "pane_player_720"},
  {"op": "capture", "name": "pane_player_720", "desc": "1280x720 as a player sees the table after both events, before any undo: no drawer, no GM buttons and no Undo (the Undo toasts are the GM's, UI_TASTE G14); a glass chip per event in its own icon, 'The bridge fell', 'Trees fell in the forest' and 'A fire swept through the forest' (flame) (G13), over the felled stand"},
  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/events_pane.gd", "action": "gm", "phase": "look", "for": "pane_player_720"},
  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/events_pane.gd", "action": "window", "size": "1920x1080", "phase": "look", "for": "pane_toasts_720,pane_player_720"},
  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/events_pane.gd", "action": "undo", "phase": "look", "for": "*pane_*"},
  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/events_pane.gd", "action": "undo", "phase": "look", "for": "*pane_*"},
  {"op": "wait", "s": 2.0, "phase": "look", "for": "*pane_*"},
  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/events_pane.gd", "action": "dismiss", "phase": "look", "for": "*pane_*"},

  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/events_pane.gd", "action": "close", "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/terrain_events.gd", "action": "look", "at": "forest", "zoom": 16.0, "lift": 4.0, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "wait", "s": 2.0, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "capture", "name": "fire_0_before", "desc": "Fire, before: the same stand of trees at tabletop zoom, the view raised 4 m so the crowns are in frame"},
  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/terrain_events.gd", "action": "fire", "kind": "fire", "radius": 7.0, "seed": 7, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/terrain_events.gd", "action": "advance", "s": 0.5, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "wait", "s": 0.3, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "capture", "name": "fire_1_catch", "desc": "0.5 s: the trees at the click catch, their crowns glowing ember orange in patches, a painted flame on each"},
  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/terrain_events.gd", "action": "advance", "s": 0.7, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "wait", "s": 0.3, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "capture", "name": "fire_2_spread", "desc": "1.2 s: the front running outward, the first crowns charring and losing their leaves, plum smoke starting over the middle"},
  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/terrain_events.gd", "action": "advance", "s": 0.7, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "wait", "s": 0.3, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "capture", "name": "fire_3_front", "desc": "1.9 s: the front near the rim, bare charred snags in the middle under rising billows"},
  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/terrain_events.gd", "action": "advance", "s": 0.7, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "wait", "s": 0.3, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "capture", "name": "fire_4_rim", "desc": "2.6 s: the last trees at the rim burning, a stand of charred snags behind them"},
  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/terrain_events.gd", "action": "advance", "s": 0.8, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "wait", "s": 0.3, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "capture", "name": "fire_5_smoke", "desc": "3.4 s: the flames dying, the snags starting to shrink away under the smoke"},
  {"op": "call", "script": "res://tools/render_jobs/probes/terrain_events.gd", "action": "advance", "s": 0.8, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "wait", "s": 0.5, "phase": "look", "for": "fire_*"},
  {"op": "capture", "name": "fire_6_change", "desc": "4.2 s: the change has landed (the burnt biome and the ash), snags growing in under the last smoke"},
